course: dictionary
lesson: 3981
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 2
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. The word gala can mean a party, a swimming race, or a big festival. To pick the right meaning, look at the words around it. Those words are the context, and they give you clues.
explain: «Sam wins by a fingertip at the county gala.» Sam is racing, and «fingertip» is a tiny gap in the water, so a gala here is a swimming competition. A gala can also be a special party with fancy clothes, or a big public fair.
explain: Try your meaning in the sentence. Put in «a swimming competition» and read it again: «Sam wins by a fingertip at the county swimming competition.» It still makes sense, so you have found the right meaning.
fact: Gala is a noun. You can say a gala or some galas.
fact: «Gala» means a special party or performance held to celebrate something, often with fancy clothes.
fact: In the UK, Australia and New Zealand, «a swimming gala» is a swimming competition.
fact: «Chūnwǎn» is the Spring Festival TV Gala, a special TV show that families watch on New Year's Eve.
fact: A gala tells the reader the event is special and grand.
exercise: «Sam wins by a fingertip at the county gala, and Dev says, "About time, mate."» What kind of event is a gala here? | *A swimming competition | A cooking class | A school exam | A quiet walk in the park
exercise: «The whole family watches the TV Gala on New Year's Eve.» What is the TV Gala? | *A special TV show celebrating the Spring Festival | A tent for camping | A swimming race | A dinner for two
exercise: «A gala dinner» with fancy clothes is a grand event. What does the word gala tell the reader about the event? | It happens every single day | It is a secret | It is cheap and boring | *It is special and grand
test: «Sam trains at 6am three times a week, and Muscles repair during sleep. Why does the text say gaming till midnight before a gala makes you worse?» | Because games make you grow taller | *Because your body needs sleep to repair muscles | Because gaming is a sport | Because midnight is too early for a meal
test: In «a swimming gala», which meaning of gala fits best? | A rainy day at the pool | A big public fair with rides and food | A type of swimsuit | *A swimming competition
exam: Read «The whole family folds dumplings together and watches the TV Gala.» Which clue shows that gala means a special TV show and not a race? | The word whole | The family folds dumplings | The word together | *The family watches it together on New Year's Eve
